abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for Contextual Resource Allocation Vignettes
  (CRAV), a sequential vignette framework for examining how artificial agents
  revise resource-allocation decisions as additional contextual information
  about a recipient is progressively revealed.

keywords:
  - "large language models"
  - "artificial agents"
  - "resource allocation"
  - "fairness"
  - "deservingness"
  - "moral updating"
  - "behavioural audit"
  - "sequential vignettes"

